{
  "_readme": [
    "Pull rates for the EV model, as EXPECTED CARDS PER PACK per bucket.",
    "No publisher releases odds. `setRates` holds per-set figures from studies that counted",
    "packs — TCGplayer's Authentication Center for Pokemon, release-window box openings for",
    "Riftbound — and those win. `templates` are era fallbacks for sets nobody has counted.",
    "Expected-count form is deliberate: EV is linear in it, so the model stays exact without",
    "pretending to know slot internals. A rate matches buckets by rarity/printing/variant;",
    "when several match, they are weighted by card count, because a pull is uniform over cards."
  ],
